  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul and Timothy, servants of Christ Jesus,",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po",
        "vid": "PHP 1:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To all God's holy people in Christ Jesus at Philippi, together with the overseers and deacons",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thanksgiving and Prayer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thank my God every time I remember you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In all my prayers for all of you, I always pray with joy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because of your partnership in the gospel from the first day until now,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "being confident of this, that he who began a good work in you will carry it on to completion until the day of Christ Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is right for me to feel this way about all of you, since I have you in my heart and, whether I am in chains or defending and confirming the gospel, all of you share in God's grace with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God can testify how I long for all of you with the affection of Christ Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is my prayer: that your love may abound more and more in knowledge and depth of insight,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that you may be able to discern what is best and may be pure and blameless for the day of Christ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "filled with the fruit of righteousness that comes through Jesus Christ—to the glory and praise of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul's Chains Advance the Gospel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I want you to know, brothers and sisters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "that what has happened to me has actually served to advance the gospel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a result, it has become clear throughout the whole palace guard",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and to everyone else that I am in chains for Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And because of my chains, most of the brothers and sisters have become confident in the Lord and dare all the more to proclaim the gospel without fear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is true that some preach Christ out of envy and rivalry, but others out of goodwill.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The latter do so out of love, knowing that I am put here for the defense of the gospel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The former preach Christ out of selfish ambition, not sincerely, supposing that they can stir up trouble for me while I am in chains.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But what does it matter? The important thing is that in every way, whether from false motives or true, Christ is preached. And because of this I rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "PHP 1:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, and I will continue to rejoice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for I know that through your prayers and God's provision of the Spirit of Jesus Christ what has happened to me will turn out for my deliverance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I eagerly expect and hope that I will in no way be ashamed, but will have sufficient courage so that now as always Christ will be exalted in my body, whether by life or by death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For to me, to live is Christ and to die is gain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I am to go on living in the body, this will mean fruitful labor for me. Yet what shall I choose? I do not know!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am torn between the two: I desire to depart and be with Christ, which is better by far;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but it is more necessary for you that I remain in the body.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Convinced of this, I know that I will remain, and I will continue with all of you for your progress and joy in the faith,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that through my being with you again your boasting in Christ Jesus will abound on account of me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Life Worthy of the Gospel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whatever happens, conduct yourselves in a manner worthy of the gospel of Christ. Then, whether I come and see you or only hear about you in my absence, I will know that you stand firm in the one Spirit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "striving together as one for the faith of the gospel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "without being frightened in any way by those who oppose you. This is a sign to them that they will be destroyed, but that you will be saved—and that by God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it has been granted to you on behalf of Christ not only to believe in him, but also to suffer for him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "since you are going through the same struggle you saw I had, and now hear that I still have.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PHP.2",
    "number": "2",
